Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Suggested Experiments", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"47d63b69-7a09-424d-95e7-d45c118a990b"],

Cell["\<\
1. Switch Optimizer from \"NelderMead\" or \"Powell\" to \"LBFGS\" and \
compare Obj Evals (hundreds vs ~8-12 evaluations).\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"3b1f9923-a830-4945-98ca-c15fbf7e35b4"],

Cell["\<\
2. Raise Offset (Hz) toward 400 Hz and observe how analytical adjoint \
gradients track both the optimal nutation frequency wRF and phase rotation \
angle simultaneously.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"fcf415eb-c6e2-4d9b-a6b9-be9060356bef"],

Cell["\<\
3. Compare LineSearch -> \"StrongWolfe\" vs \"HagerZhang\" near off-resonance \
starting guesses.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"dc49640d-be16-4088-b61e-cbfffd816045"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Summary", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"be211568-6296-44ef-ac42-42f0adfd0672"],

Cell["\<\
Compiled problem evaluation plus O(1) analytical adjoint gradients turns \
millisecond-scale NMR pulse optimizations from seconds of symbolic \
FindMinimum evaluations into ~4-10 ms solves with strict HoldAll isolation.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6154a0ba-8898-4869-b046-8536dad736b9"],

